{"3798860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shutter Story", "steam_appid": 3798860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your best friend Eli is convinced his family is being haunted. At first you don't believe him. But then he shows you the photos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eli's parents dismiss it as an overactive imagination. He needs clearer evidence. As a budding photo editor, that's where you come in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Walls Have Eyes... and Faces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/4de8b78fcbbf36cc5088005dc464b689.poster.avif?t=1785336573\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/4de8b78fcbbf36cc5088005dc464b689.webm?t=1785336573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/4de8b78fcbbf36cc5088005dc464b689.mp4?t=1785336573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the latest <i>SpectralAware™ 2.1</i> software to analyze Eli's family photos and home videos. Adjust the exposure, contrast and noise, and apply different filters to reveal the horrors hiding in plain sight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choices Have Consequences</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/050bb148bb483321c668e13b48ed322e.poster.avif?t=1785336573\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/050bb148bb483321c668e13b48ed322e.webm?t=1785336573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/050bb148bb483321c668e13b48ed322e.mp4?t=1785336573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of a detailed manual, sort your findings into different categories - Apparitions, Simulacra, Strange Lights, Demonic Entities, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's vital you get it right, as mistakes carry consequences - the fate of Eli and his family rests on your answers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hereditary Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/1b8269b7c816150946810e958856c540.poster.avif?t=1785336573\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/1b8269b7c816150946810e958856c540.webm?t=1785336573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/1b8269b7c816150946810e958856c540.mp4?t=1785336573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the family's history - and, if you're observant - the true reason behind the hauntings, inherited and handed down from generation to generation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between photo investigations, explore the house in tense first-person sections where the consequences of your actions bleed  into the present-day.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/ff8f686f46520c1998317f84c77eab4f.poster.avif?t=1785336573\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/ff8f686f46520c1998317f84c77eab4f.webm?t=1785336573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/ff8f686f46520c1998317f84c77eab4f.mp4?t=1785336573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Slow-Burn Horror Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Her Story</i>, <i>Mouthwashing, Home Safety Hotline</i>, and Kiyoshi Kurosawa's masterpiece horror film <i>Pulse</i> (2001), <strong>this is true psychological horror that lingers <i>long after</i> you've logged off. You may feel you're being watched in your own home. Are you up for it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An in-game computer with <i>SpectralAware™ 2.1 </i>- a photo and video analysis tool for detecting the paranormal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ haunting photos and video clips that dig through a hidden, multi-generational narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person sections in the house where the present-day  horror turns to immediate terror around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp, gripping and cathartic storytelling from Frostwood Interactive (<i>Rainswept</i>, <i>Unwording</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An early-2000s style OS with Frutiger Aero aesthetics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your best friend Eli is convinced his family is being haunted. At first you don't believe him. But then he shows you the photos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eli's parents dismiss it as an overactive imagination. He needs clearer evidence. As a budding photo editor, that's where you come in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Walls Have Eyes... and Faces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/4de8b78fcbbf36cc5088005dc464b689.poster.avif?t=1785336573\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/4de8b78fcbbf36cc5088005dc464b689.webm?t=1785336573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/4de8b78fcbbf36cc5088005dc464b689.mp4?t=1785336573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the latest <i>SpectralAware™ 2.1</i> software to analyze Eli's family photos and home videos. Adjust the exposure, contrast and noise, and apply different filters to reveal the horrors hiding in plain sight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choices Have Consequences</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/050bb148bb483321c668e13b48ed322e.poster.avif?t=1785336573\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/050bb148bb483321c668e13b48ed322e.webm?t=1785336573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/050bb148bb483321c668e13b48ed322e.mp4?t=1785336573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of a detailed manual, sort your findings into different categories - Apparitions, Simulacra, Strange Lights, Demonic Entities, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's vital you get it right, as mistakes carry consequences - the fate of Eli and his family rests on your answers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hereditary Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/1b8269b7c816150946810e958856c540.poster.avif?t=1785336573\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/1b8269b7c816150946810e958856c540.webm?t=1785336573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/1b8269b7c816150946810e958856c540.mp4?t=1785336573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the family's history - and, if you're observant - the true reason behind the hauntings, inherited and handed down from generation to generation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between photo investigations, explore the house in tense first-person sections where the consequences of your actions bleed  into the present-day.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/ff8f686f46520c1998317f84c77eab4f.poster.avif?t=1785336573\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/ff8f686f46520c1998317f84c77eab4f.webm?t=1785336573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/ff8f686f46520c1998317f84c77eab4f.mp4?t=1785336573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Slow-Burn Horror Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Her Story</i>, <i>Mouthwashing, Home Safety Hotline</i>, and Kiyoshi Kurosawa's masterpiece horror film <i>Pulse</i> (2001), <strong>this is true psychological horror that lingers <i>long after</i> you've logged off. You may feel you're being watched in your own home. Are you up for it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An in-game computer with <i>SpectralAware™ 2.1 </i>- a photo and video analysis tool for detecting the paranormal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ haunting photos and video clips that dig through a hidden, multi-generational narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person sections in the house where the present-day  horror turns to immediate terror around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp, gripping and cathartic storytelling from Frostwood Interactive (<i>Rainswept</i>, <i>Unwording</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An early-2000s style OS with Frutiger Aero aesthetics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Examine a family's photo album to reveal signs of the paranormal, as the horror unfolds in the house around you. Their fate is in your hands.", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“Shutter Story inevitably comps to other self-guided investigation games, but none suit it perfectly. It’s fully unique. That’s why it’s quickly become one of my most anticipated games of the year.”<br>Thinky Games<br><br>“As a horror fan, I’ve been spoiled for choice this year, but Shutter Story by Frostwood Interactive has been a highlight.”<br>The Guardian<br><br>“Sounds like some good, spooky fun.”<br>PC Gamer<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/4e5a865be283a2cf0ceaf60d305a6fd8fe26ff2e/header.jpg?t=1785336573", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/26460fbf3f533414f1a8ade056efaac926882922/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785336573", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/26460fbf3f533414f1a8ade056efaac926882922/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785336573", "website": "http://www.frostwoodinteractive.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-6300HQ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-1135G7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Frostwood Interactive"], "publishers": ["Frostwood Interactive"], "demos": [{"appid": 4107750, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/8a17ec274d7b84967b3befc6eef83c164c67e295/ss_8a17ec274d7b84967b3befc6eef83c164c67e295.600x338.jpg?t=1785336573", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/8a17ec274d7b84967b3befc6eef83c164c67e295/ss_8a17ec274d7b84967b3befc6eef83c164c67e295.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785336573"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/3ddc8d94c78f5e100879d5f18a6e08d4cf6d946b/ss_3ddc8d94c78f5e100879d5f18a6e08d4cf6d946b.600x338.jpg?t=1785336573", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as